      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is always so busy and it takes forever to get an appointment or even get a call back. the cramps are making it really hard to sleep. i checked my last labs from a few months ago and my potassium was actually on the lower end of normal. would it be safe to just try a small amount for a few days to see if the cramps go away before i bother calling them? like maybe just one or two of those 99mg pills? it feels like a low enough dose to be safe.",
